   options=O(("Wakefulness","Yes. A state of alertness as opposed to deep sleep or coma.",1),("Awareness of a particular thing","Yes. Noticing a sound or a feeling.",1),("There being something it is like to have an experience","Yes. Nagel's phrase for the sense most researchers find hardest.",1),("Being intelligent","No. The lesson treats intelligence as a separate topic. See the Lexicon for how the terms differ.",0)),
